<title>USA: Catherines Stores Jan same-store sales flat.</title>
<headline>Catherines Stores Jan same-store sales flat.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	 $16.3	$18.6	  n/a	 flat</p>
<p>13-weeks    63.1	 67.8	   n/a	-5.6</p>
<p>52-weeks    $268.0     $274.1	-2.2	-5.3</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is  four  weeks ended February 1   .</p>
<p>Full company name is Catherine Stores Corp</p>
<p>NOTE: Last year's January contained five weeks versus four weeks this January. In the above table, January 1997 total sales of $16.3 million cover four-week period while January 1996 total sales million cover five-week period. Total sales on a comparable four-week basis increased 3.2 percent, the company said.</p>
</text>
